<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <PackageId>Ozakboy.Security</PackageId>
    <AssemblyName>Ozakboy.Security</AssemblyName>
    <RootNamespace>Ozakboy.Security</RootNamespace>

    <Title>Ozakboy.Security — 憑證與敏感資料保護</Title>
    <Description>.NET 憑證與敏感資料保護工具:Windows DPAPI 金鑰保護(介面優先的 ISecretProtector,非 Windows 可替換實作,並提供不拋例外的 TryUnprotect)、日誌敏感字串遮罩(字串頭尾保留、URL query 參數、JSON 欄位,名稱比對忽略大小寫)、AES-GCM 設定檔加密(自帶版本標頭、每次產生新 nonce)與 PBKDF2 金鑰派生。除 DPAPI 所需的 Microsoft 官方 System.Security.Cryptography.ProtectedData 外,零第三方相依。Credential and sensitive-data protection for .NET: Windows DPAPI secret protection behind a substitutable interface, log masking for plain strings, URL query parameters and JSON fields, AES-GCM configuration encryption with a versioned envelope, and PBKDF2 key derivation. No third-party dependencies.</Description>
    <PackageTags>ozakboy;security;dpapi;data-protection;secret;credential;api-key;masking;redaction;log-masking;aes-gcm;encryption;configuration;pbkdf2;key-derivation;dotnet;csharp</PackageTags>

    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/ozakboy/Ozakboy.Security</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/ozakboy/Ozakboy.Security</RepositoryUrl>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>0.1.1: adds the shared ozakboy package icon, shown on nuget.org and in IDE package managers. No code changed; package metadata cannot be altered on an already-published version, so refreshing the icon required a new one. 0.1.0: first release, targeting net10.0 with no third-party dependencies. DPAPI secret protection behind the substitutable ISecretProtector (Protect / Unprotect / TryUnprotect for strings and bytes, IsSupported platform check); DpapiSecretProtector wraps its output in an OZDP envelope (magic, format version, scope) so malformed payloads, unknown versions and scope mismatches are detected before decryption, and throws PlatformNotSupportedException with guidance off Windows; DpapiProtectionOptions documents what additional entropy does and does not protect against. Log masking with SecretMasker: plain strings keep both ends visible behind a fixed-length mask that never reveals more than a third of the value, sensitive URL query parameters (names percent-decoded before matching, //user:password@host targets covered) and JSON fields are masked by case-insensitive name and substring fragments, password-like fields are always masked in full, and a thread-safe registry of known secret literals (RegisterKnownSecret / MaskText, minimum length 8) catches formatted log messages and exception text. Configuration encryption with ConfigurationProtector: AES-GCM with a fresh nonce per call and an OZCF versioned envelope used as the authenticated associated data, IsProtectedValue and IsSupported checks, and TryDecrypt that never leaks PlatformNotSupportedException. KeyDerivation: PBKDF2 (HMAC-SHA256) with a 600,000 iteration default and 100,000 minimum, a 16-byte minimum salt per NIST SP 800-132, a span-based password overload the caller can zero, and secure salt and key generation. SecretProtectionException and SecretProtectionFailureReason give both protection paths one classified failure model. See https://github.com/ozakboy/Ozakboy.Security/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md</PackageReleaseNotes>

    <GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="..\..\LICENSE" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
    <None Include="..\..\README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
    <None Include="..\..\logo.png" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <!--
    刻意不引用 Microsoft.SourceLink.GitHub 套件,與其他 Ozakboy.* 套件一致。
    自 .NET 8 起 SourceLink 已內建於 SDK,設定 PublishRepositoryUrl 與 EmbedUntrackedSources
    (見 Directory.Build.props)即可 —— 已實測確認打包出的 nuspec 帶有
    repository 元素(type / url / branch 齊備),與外掛套件的結果相同。
    外掛套件反而多帶一條相依鏈,其中 10.0.300 版帶進的 Microsoft.Build.Tasks.Git 有安全通報,
    在 TreatWarningsAsErrors 之下會讓「還原」階段就直接失敗。
  -->
  <ItemGroup>
    <!-- DPAPI 在 .NET 上必須透過此官方套件取得(Microsoft 發佈,零第三方遞移相依) -->
    <PackageReference Include="System.Security.Cryptography.ProtectedData" Version="10.0.12" />
    <!--
      0.2.0 起的 ASP.NET Core 整合面:設定值自動解密、DI 註冊、日誌遮罩。
      四個都是 Microsoft.Extensions.* 的抽象層或 Options,遞移相依只有 Microsoft.Extensions.Primitives,
      沒有第三方套件;刻意不引用 Microsoft.Extensions.Logging / .Configuration 本體,
      日誌整合是以 ActivatorUtilities 包住既有的 ILoggerFactory 註冊,不需要認得 LoggerFactory 型別。
      The ASP.NET Core integration surface added in 0.2.0: configuration decryption, DI registration and
      log masking. All four are Microsoft.Extensions.* abstractions or Options, whose only transitive
      dependency is Microsoft.Extensions.Primitives; no third-party package. The non-abstract
      Microsoft.Extensions.Logging / .Configuration packages are deliberately not referenced: the logging
      integration decorates whatever ILoggerFactory is registered via ActivatorUtilities and never needs
      the concrete LoggerFactory type.
    -->
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.Configuration.Abstractions" Version="10.0.12" />
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.Abstractions" Version="10.0.12" />
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.Abstractions" Version="10.0.12" />
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.Options" Version="10.0.12" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
